Z||000000||Oreif||12-01-2001||11:59 AM||||Due to my ISP being AT&T @Home, and Excite going bankrupt, I no longer have access to my @home account. I don't know how long it will be down. <BR>Please use kopiedj@yahoo.com for Email communication. I know there are some members<BR>who have ordered door tabs. I am trying to recover my old Emails that I received and will Email you. If You don't get an Email from me by Saturday eveing please use the above Email address.<P>Thanks,<BR><P>------------------<BR>            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">          <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT>||||reg||4
